  "content": "\n\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_945056aa-921e-44e4-85dd-f45231940861.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"316\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/potionstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4bce6dd3-7af5-4014-a705-04cd0c0adb87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zQA4eez2eS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2e3d72d9-91b0-4d00-8eef-26be28254a6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f_AOCAWOL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84597b2e-8453-472a-9043-329d8218ac75.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>\"你脑中自有思想，你脚下自有路途。你可以自己选择前行的方向。</em>&nbsp;<em>你独自上路。你所知道的一切皆由你掌握。而你，就是那个决定何去何从的人\"</em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>——苏斯博士，《你去的地方》（Oh, The Places You'll Go!）&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_a1820aba-6e98-496b-954b-53c078297080.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"71\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wayfinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_f80168f8-5c01-42cf-a924-b36e91cafca5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"594\" height=\"101\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-descent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_7acdccbe-8e6f-49f6-bde2-ee820d4370a9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"596\" height=\"68\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_10da38ee-7e1c-4d1d-9bf5-d07267b232ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"616\" height=\"116\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone 是经典模组 Oh The Biomes You'll Go 的续作，支持 1.20+ 版本，新增 50 多个令人叹为观止、充满魔法色彩且真实自然的生物群系。BWG 将为 Minecraft 增添多样而生动的细节，带你踏上一段奇妙的冒险之旅。此外，BWG 还加入了全新的独特生物、建筑结构和数百种可供利用的新方块。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_43d7961e-7fe6-4cab-9073-f96e1a05c5bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"793\" height=\"416\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要 1.19 及以下版本的吗？请查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span></a>！</p>",
